  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "30516721-fc5d-47d7-ace2-0558ff9ad86e"],
 " is calculated from it. Before the reading occurs, the definition is a \
one-to-one change of random variable:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"30db3b9c-7c1b-4194-b9ae-a3e48b6c5d86"],

